                        "review": "Grimind was an interesting Horror themed, puzzle platformer where you have to try and survive dangerous entities within an expansive cavern. Whilst trying to survive you also need to solve interesting puzzles ranging from physics based propulsion rockets, Music Notes, momentum based platforming, and the more creative ones of manipulating your enemies to do your bidding! Overall, a short game that I would recommend trying out!",
